From 55ac846c72b20bf16c49a136cfe373040e5cffeb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brett Brotherton <bbrotherton@google.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Apr 2026 13:53:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Replace base::ByteSwap with std::byteswap

Migrate from using `base::ByteSwap` to the standard C++23
`std::byteswap` function for byte order swapping in AVRCP packet
building. This involves including `<bit>` instead of
`<base/sys_byteorder.h>`.

Bug: 474077758
Flag: EXEMPT PURE_REFACTOR
Test: atest net_test_btpackets
Change-Id: Ie87300c33b53b445087c5ef737c0278762f9cfa2
---
 system/packet/avrcp/avrcp_browse_packet.cc    |  4 +-
 system/packet/avrcp/avrcp_packet.cc           |  4 +-
 system/packet/avrcp/change_path.cc            |  8 ++--
 system/packet/avrcp/get_folder_items.cc       | 42 +++++++++----------
 system/packet/avrcp/get_item_attributes.cc    |  8 ++--
 system/packet/avrcp/get_play_status_packet.cc |  6 +--
 .../packet/avrcp/get_total_number_of_items.cc |  6 +--
 .../avrcp/register_notification_packet.cc     | 14 +++----
 system/packet/avrcp/set_browsed_player.cc     | 10 ++---
 system/packet/avrcp/vendor_packet.cc          | 10 ++---
 10 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 56 deletions(-)

diff --git a/system/packet/avrcp/avrcp_browse_packet.cc b/system/packet/avrcp/avrcp_browse_packet.cc
index 4947d3ffb9..321131ff1f 100644
